<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Pass@1 results on HumanEval and MBPP for the pre-trained LLMs, SafeCoder fine-tuned LLMs, and Secure-Instruct (ours) fine-tuned LLMs.</figcaption>
